Upstream declares the following example to use the BSD license without
specifying a clause count. No more specific BSD variant is inferred.

Source: examples/old/freeverb.dsp

declare name        "freeverb";
declare version     "1.0";
declare author      "Grame";
declare license     "BSD";
declare copyright   "(c) GRAME 2006";
declare reference   "https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/Freeverb.html";
